# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks

# Updated: 2026-07-29 - app/debug.keystore is deliberately committed, not a
# secret. It's the standard Android debug keystore (well-known "android"
# password, "androiddebugkey" alias) - the whole point is a fixed, shared
# keystore so every CI build signs identically and adb install -r can
# update in place. This is never used as a release-signing key.
!app/debug.keystore
